{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>2021年港姐季軍暨友誼小姐邵初（Kristy）近年憑無綫（TVB）處境劇《愛．回家之開心速遞》中飾演「Minnie」一角成功入屋，與KC（歐瑞偉飾）組成CP亦</p><p>2021年港姐季軍暨友誼小姐邵初（Kristy）近年憑無綫（TVB）處境劇《愛．回家之開心速遞》中飾演「Minnie」一角成功入屋，與KC（歐瑞偉飾）組成CP亦大受歡迎。日前邵初迎來32歲生日，她在IG曬出慶生短片，並寫道：「I m just a 20year old girl born in 1994 why is everyone telling me I m 32 🤔（我只是個1994年出生的20歲女孩，為什麼大家都說我32歲？）」</p><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20230427/728373522593878016250964.jpeg/r1xCvwy6XiOIkA39O4nG0pJboOyZbni1DxnPqg8Zz6o\" alt=\"邵初在2021年參選港姐奪得季軍後入行。（IG@kristyshaw.c）\"><figcaption>邵初在2021年參選港姐奪得季軍後入行。（IG@kristyshaw.c）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20230505/731226752932122624926458.jpeg/dc3a6HiM6aO8zP1bryFCaIOPjQk23aXGqCDHo6ggx6M\" alt=\"慶祝生日。（IG@kristyshaw.c）\"><figcaption>慶祝生日。（IG@kristyshaw.c）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260505/1128414335295688704681709.jpeg/vFrWEP3TOEPgrDIrLkf55At17F_LF_rI6QpL_OkKS_w\" alt=\"度假look。（IG@kristyshaw.c）\"><figcaption>度假look。（IG@kristyshaw.c）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260227/1103860468768182272245389.jpeg/V34GDDxKQdLOt4vEiDCffNrqWgp4I4LNrLBhyqywYco\" alt=\"度假look。（IG@kristyshaw.c）\"><figcaption>度假look。（IG@kristyshaw.c）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260505/1128414332133052416629741.jpeg/Veg970LFem8Sf41YiRx_SRvARpaRrqyJBbxSZQW8UmU\" alt=\"身材出眾。（IG@kristyshaw.c）\"><figcaption>身材出眾。（IG@kristyshaw.c）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260505/1128414699122069504109583.jpeg/mBzajzJMdiqQjYR8CKA3-_vJjgOIMnC31K4zitSuM4o\" alt=\"晚裝look。（IG@kristyshaw.c）\"><figcaption>晚裝look。（IG@kristyshaw.c）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240725/893203753396736000856912.jpeg/2SK7rP6JWxIU2VzR3lLweTz3Yai-wLOQOnkqnzp5Kp8\" alt=\"邵初加入《愛．回家之開心速遞》。（IG@kristyshaw.c）\"><figcaption>邵初加入《愛．回家之開心速遞》。（IG@kristyshaw.c）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240725/893203759877328896716853.jpeg/bA3yiy_e-B_HVY67FluSxDWuOYEicKGDtXfUILV31CA\" alt=\"飾演律師Minnie。（YouTube影片截圖）\"><figcaption>飾演律師Minnie。（YouTube影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240725/893203748233547776687905.jpeg/5bIkPfre9qxZJQxdVHrqaJo53D76eEJmjrRxhY60cYU\" alt=\"但就被KC（歐瑞偉飾）針對。（YouTube影片截圖）\"><figcaption>但就被KC（歐瑞偉飾）針對。（YouTube影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260505/1128414702825771008193640.jpeg/WfgYiQ4YeWOvIqOcleFVJ_ENIk4PC6u_r6q31q-qt9Y\" alt=\"大受歡迎！（IG@kristyshaw.c）\"><figcaption>大受歡迎！（IG@kristyshaw.c）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260505/1128414191582187520167958.jpeg/JaQjKUQ-4FsOIJdT3Y5KL6sBoxyYz8dqVa9H8FWvR_A\" alt=\"慶祝32歲生日。（影片截圖）\"><figcaption>慶祝32歲生日。（影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260505/1128414188834787328978246.jpeg/2Mt26OndUpwMc1sMyZggPJqtwXe81f0MwcBnBcHAZwU\" alt=\"慶祝32歲生日。（影片截圖）\"><figcaption>慶祝32歲生日。（影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260505/1128414186078998528069718.jpeg/vMNT_hppBlLvIoidJ3H5909C_oe2BiUrkBa4C5AWuAs\" alt=\"慶祝32歲生日。（影片截圖）\"><figcaption>慶祝32歲生日。（影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><p>邵初曾被嘲「老餅港姐」</p><p>邵初自加入TVB以來主持過不少節目，曾陪曾志偉到珠海出席樓盤活動，一度被指極速上位，成為新寵。身為中越混血兒的邵初，外形出眾，但由於樣貌偏成熟，多次被網民針對她的年紀，更慘被批是「老餅港姐」，她亦曾坦言因被批「好樣衰、好老、好肥」而感到傷心，不過她就愈戰愈勇，除了有份參演重頭劇《巾幗梟雄之懸崖》之外，近年又憑《愛．回家之開心速遞》中的演出大獲好評！</p><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20241121/936345486422446080984316.jpeg/PTiOgKU0a3nf4KZIjz68q6yYCTOq26KkgsoWqYLKFqk\" alt=\"性感！（IG@kristyshaw.c）\"><figcaption>性感！（IG@kristyshaw.c）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20241119/935621562059591680316872.jpeg/zw7t9UIx8Uzu1joGg1WZ0yWsoC6o2YB8XTCWzWswls0\" alt=\"葉蒨文及邵初。（葉志明攝）\"><figcaption>葉蒨文及邵初。（葉志明攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260424/1124455854977060864570613.jpeg/dBTnM5yx4K1tGVO9ENCSDhFSl2MvfIr39CLzQ_Qi80M\" alt=\"內衣上陣！（IG@kristyshaw.c）\"><figcaption>內衣上陣！（IG@kristyshaw.c）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260424/1124455859469422592815940.jpeg/w4brYCrWhu0Xwx0GcuCEcDRz8z2xS9rSDaPCLw2jwi8\" alt=\"內衣上陣！（IG@kristyshaw.c）\"><figcaption>內衣上陣！（IG@kristyshaw.c）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260424/1124455857183395840873510.jpeg/AAXTtG-Qbf4gDtSih6AJQpNWzLtmngol8M-3Q_DPt0M\" alt=\"內衣上陣！（IG@kristyshaw.c）\"><figcaption>內衣上陣！（IG@kristyshaw.c）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260505/1128414705246015488657128.jpeg/-9Ssv3Kv_zkbwY7euYVGKb5kNOoNIrR9fpbYtH6W2LQ\" alt=\"大露背！（IG@kristyshaw.c）\"><figcaption>大露背！（IG@kristyshaw.c）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240613/877925220248719360938715.jpeg/d_8p3B-D56Cds-LF01rVocISpWIOlzBeHhIJnh4SCZ4\" alt=\"邵初主持過不少節目。（IG@kristyshaw.c）\"><figcaption>邵初主持過不少節目。（IG@kristyshaw.c）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20230523/737677907857510400205387.jpeg/rT33HNCe2EXHeWX_OcODht293FnPGyAciPU7J4j1Oyc\" alt=\"邵初曾陪曾志偉到珠海出席樓盤活動，一度被指極速上位，成為新寵。（IG@kristyshaw.c）\"><figcaption>邵初曾陪曾志偉到珠海出席樓盤活動，一度被指極速上位，成為新寵。（IG@kristyshaw.c）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240613/877925215425007616074168.jpeg/bFNoeeciy__5UynGUZT1PgX1Dk6m-8ZOg2aDNYNmgzU\" alt=\"外形出眾。（IG@kristyshaw.c）\"><figcaption>外形出眾。（IG@kristyshaw.c）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240613/877925207992438784912704.jpeg/IWH0QPuZVkI-EDkKok2hyKNiD8GspCmc639LTet_S00\" alt=\"大曬泳衣照。（IG@kristyshaw.c）\"><figcaption>大曬泳衣照。（IG@kristyshaw.c）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20230714/756487122886070272201365.jpeg/nkqDJXQ0SCy-_DvQu6QKEJfUl3MbV3J50i-oh9IvqIc\" alt=\"邵初曾在旅遊節目《請1日假去旅行》中坦言因被批「好樣衰、好老、好肥」而感到傷心。（電視截圖）\"><figcaption>邵初曾在旅遊節目《請1日假去旅行》中坦言因被批「好樣衰、好老、好肥」而感到傷心。（電視截圖）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-05-06T01:23:32.253330+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":1101,"images":24,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none"}}